{"unit_id":"misakimiku2__dsh-cost-display#feature-1","repo":"misakimiku2/dsh-cost-display","commit":"ea859b2a07344076c393f778f19876e493aab4fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost-display 的功能「会话费用估算」：插件从请求头读取当前模型，并用 token 用量、该模型的价格档及请求时段计算累计费用；相同步骤的更新会替换旧用量。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/cost-projection.js:75-105","lib/pricing.js:67-74"]}
{"unit_id":"misakimiku2__dsh-cost-display#feature-2","repo":"misakimiku2/dsh-cost-display","commit":"ea859b2a07344076c393f778f19876e493aab4fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost-display 的功能「按模型查看明细」：对话界面在状态栏显示会话费用，悬停可查看按模型拆分的 token 数和费用明细，包括思维链 token 统计。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:11-14","lib/cost-projection.js:108-112"]}
{"unit_id":"misakimiku2__dsh-cost-display#feature-3","repo":"misakimiku2/dsh-cost-display","commit":"ea859b2a07344076c393f778f19876e493aab4fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost-display 的功能「编辑模型价格」：设置界面提供模型价格表、生效日期、峰谷窗口、每模型峰谷开关和兜底价格，修改后的设置供后续计费读取。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:19-24","lib/index.js:44-53"]}
{"unit_id":"misakimiku2__dsh-cost-display#feature-4","repo":"misakimiku2/dsh-cost-display","commit":"ea859b2a07344076c393f778f19876e493aab4fd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cost-display 的功能「同步模型列表」：插件从 provider 设置命名空间收集模型 ID，并将价格表缺少的模型以兜底价补入；已有价格不会被覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:61-88","lib/index.js:90-99"]}
